# Regatta start buoy: a round buoy (o lit top left, r body, R shadow
# bottom right) with a w/i band, a short m/d pole and a small Y/o flag,
# k outline, sitting on the water line (sprite row 31, with w ripples).
# idle: frame 1 bobs up 1 px and the flag waves. Front-layer prop.
# Drawn by the pixel-artist with a throwaway script; the grids are the source.
sprite = startboje
size   = 16x32
origin = 8,32
anim   = idle frames=2 ticks=20 loop
